# Output

```svelte
<div class={'asd' + boo}>asd</div>

{#if 'foo'}
    a
{:else if 'bar'}
    b
{/if}

{#await Promise.resolve('hi')}
    a
{/await}

{#each ['a'] as b}
    a
{/each}

<p>"{'hello'}" world</p>

<button on:click={() => console.log('hi')}>hi</button>

<div in:asd={foo + 'bar'} out:asd={foo + 'bar'}></div>

<div transistion:asd={foo + 'bar'}></div>

<div animate:asd={foo + 'bar'}></div>
```
